{
	"name": "Incorporeal Form",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/creatures/magical/spirit-undead-ghost-blue.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As a bonus action, you may become incorporeal. While in this form, you are still visible but semi-transparent, you cannot attack, and attacks from nonmagical weapons cannot harm you. You may pass through solid objects and interact with them. You may stay in this incorporeal state for a number of rounds equal to your Constitution modifier, until you choose to voluntarily end it as a bonus action, or until you take damage. This ability may be used a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus per long rest.</p>",
